  "slug": "prompt-improver",
  "name": "Prompt Improver",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Intelligent prompt optimization using skill-based architecture. Enriches vague prompts with research-based clarifying questions before Claude Code executes them",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill** and **3 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `prompt-improver` (This skill enriches vague prompts with targeted research and clarification before execution)\n- **Hooks** (3): `UserPromptSubmit`, `PreToolUse`, `SubagentStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install prompt-improver@claude-community` from `severity1/claude-code-prompt-improver`.",
